{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a young man from a remote village reaches adulthood, it's time to embark on an adventurous journey to fulfill a fateful mission: slay a dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragons dwell at the summit of the mountain, eager to capture princesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach the summit, the brave must traverse forests, snow-capped mountains, and deserts. It's no easy task, requiring you to defeat countless monsters and solve countless puzzles. An elder known as the &quot;Wise Man&quot; will guide you with his wisdom until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, don't forget to help the villagers, as the brave are the embodiment of justice and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villagers will reward your kindness, and perhaps even a small favor will solve a crucial problem for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach the summit, the true decisive battle begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't panic. Remember the combat techniques you've learned along the way, and be careful to dodge the dragon's flames. When the dragon collapses, you've won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, brave! You've achieved a happy ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014The above content is from \u300athe Brave Training Manual\u300b published 99 years ago on the Verlan Continent. It's a classic textbook everyone has a copy of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the game rules described in the book, you successfully defeated the evil dragon, but the game is not over yet. You suddenly realize that what you have learned is not the true rules of this world...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056450?t=1758896670","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056450/765a18c412eb5b0944d877a332b0fb66301cd38d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758896670","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056450/f01e90fbfcb86492158214908193aed3262e7540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758896670","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056450/f01e90fbfcb86492158214908193aed3262e7540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758896670","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a young man from a remote village reaches adulthood, it's time to embark on an adventurous journey to fulfill a fateful mission: slay a dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragons dwell at the summit of the mountain, eager to capture princesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach the summit, the brave must traverse forests, snow-capped mountains, and deserts. It's no easy task, requiring you to defeat countless monsters and solve countless puzzles. An elder known as the &quot;Wise Man&quot; will guide you with his wisdom until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, don't forget to help the villagers, as the brave are the embodiment of justice and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villagers will reward your kindness, and perhaps even a small favor will solve a crucial problem for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach the summit, the true decisive battle begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't panic. Remember the combat techniques you've learned along the way, and be careful to dodge the dragon's flames. When the dragon collapses, you've won.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, brave! You've achieved a happy ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014The above content is from \u300athe Brave Training Manual\u300b published 99 years ago on the Verlan Continent. It's a classic textbook everyone has a copy of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the game rules described in the book, you successfully defeated the evil dragon, but the game is not over yet. You suddenly realize that what you have learned is not the true rules of this world...</p>","developers":["\u516d\u65e5Crystin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056450/02551653c0a1bb1264503b71990705020e7709c2/header.jpg?t=1758896670","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4056450/1271945038/d1358fd252b0a2909f4e2687a53c7c45e2e1ea4e/1758618079/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758896665","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4056450/1271945038/d1358fd252b0a2909f4e2687a53c7c45e2e1ea4e/1758618079/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758896665","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4056450/1271945038/d1358fd252b0a2909f4e2687a53c7c45e2e1ea4e/1758618079/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758896665","id":257204505,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204505/movie480.mp4?t=1758896665","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204505/movie_max.mp4?t=1758896665"},"name":"the brave pv","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204505/7ff2b4a5508e3ed3bf642971d3b4a5d952e999c7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758896665","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204505/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758896665","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204505/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758896665"}}],"name":"The Brave","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Window